{"articleNo":"420036","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=420036&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 대구·경북권 국립대학「영어 프레젠테이션 향상 캠프」참여자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.12.14","hit":"6294","attachments":[{"name":"대구·경북권 국립대학「영어 프레젠테이션 향상 캠프」홍보 포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=420036&attachNo=119556"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">재학생의 영어 말하기 역량 향상 및 대경권 국립대학 네트워크 활성화를 위하여</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;\">&nbsp;대구경북권국립대학공동교육혁신센터에서</span><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold;\">「</span><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold;\">영어 프레젠테이션 향상 캠프</span><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold;\">」</span><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">참여자를 모집하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -8.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일시 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2023. 1. 12.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">) ~ 1. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">/ 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">박 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일 프로그램</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">경주 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">The-K</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">호텔 </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 11pt;\">차량 지원</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">모집인원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">우리대학 재학생 선착순 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">후보자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">15</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"